001200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001300 PROGRAM-ID.    TRPTVEN.
001400 AUTHOR.        VW DELUCA.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.  FEBRUARY 1, 1985.
001600*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001700*
001800*REMARKS.       PURCHASE ORDER STATUS BY VENDOR CODE.
001900*
002000*               ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
002100*               MAY 8, 1985.     V.W.D.
002200*
002300*               REVISED PROGRAM TO PRINT A VENDOR DELIVERY SUMMARY
002400*               PAGE.  BOTH OPEN AND RECEIVED ITEMS ARE CATAGORIZED
002500*               BY THE DAYS BETWEEN PO-EXPECT-DATE (OR SHIP-DATE IF
002600*               EXPECT-DATE NA) AND THE DATE EACH ITEM IS RECEIVED.
002700*               AUG 20, 1985     V.W.D.
002800*
002900*
003000*
003100*                   ***  PREP WITH MAXDATA  ***.
003200*
003300*C 06/09/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 6219
003300*C     1. ADDED LOGIC TO SELECT BY RECEIVING DEPARTMENT AND/OR
003300*C        A RANGE OF DATES IN 550-GET-PO-HEADER.
003300*C     2. ZRSCREEN/FCODE WAS CHANGED TO PICK UP NEW SELECTION
003300*C        CRITERIA.
003300*C
      *C 09/06/96  WL MCINTYRE  REQUEST 6623
      *C     MAKE REVISIONS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPATABILITY
      *C
